; index.xon -- the official x bundles: a bare name, and where it lives.
;
; One (bundle "NAME" "REFERENCE") row a bundle, sorted by name. A reference
; is OWNER/REPO on github.com, or DOMAIN/OWNER/REPO. `x bundle install NAME`
; installs the latest release of the repository NAME's row names; a bundle
; needs no row to be installed by its reference or by its pin's URL.

(bundle "gfx" "jonruttan/x-lib-gfx")
(bundle "r5rs" "jonruttan/x-r5rs")
